<title>USA: TABLE - US Servis Inc Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - US Servis Inc Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SOMERSET, N.J. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Servis, Inc. and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>		     Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>			     (Unaudited)</p>
<p>						    Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							  June 30,</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Total Revenues			    $6,123,000 $4,791,000(A)</p>
<p> Cost of services			   4,434,000     3,361,000</p>
