<p>					   19,731,000	  20,739,000</p>
<p>(A) The Company changed its method of accounting for income recognition for business management services, whereby, revenue is recognized on collections in process as the services are performed, The effect of the change was to increase reported revenues by $35,000 for the three months ended June 30,1996. SOURCE  US Servis, Inc.</p>
